# Keep the Vercel deployment to what the site actually needs at runtime:
#   api/      serverless functions
#   core/     the audit engine they import
#   data/     the Annex A baseline
#   samples/  the demonstration profiles
#   public/   the frontend
#
# Everything below is local tooling or documentation. Excluding app/ also stops
# Vercel's entrypoint detection from ever looking at the Streamlit application.
app/
tests/
tools/
docs/
collector/
requirements-streamlit.txt
requirements-dev.txt
run.sh
README.md
LICENSE
.git/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# macOS
.DS_Store
